{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_004_01_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2c369236be1af07d28e847ee252657c5321b4ec37bdfc39f2001f8fb0916c776",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_i:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0aebb25b8cca3cb06ba94396f6a518e21f1482fdc8ec859845b51835b2b6bda8",
      "text": "一国王子竟然要去打工……\n而且，居然还是穿人偶装打工……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_i:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22d9e2719be0f349525180547bd02631081bd4af117b02271087d65ce0c22117",
      "text": "正因为是一国王子才要去啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_i:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:672aace2e45d47b683648f1c8fbd1359b32eca4c93740c4724e02e77a854d2d1",
      "text": "我想让哪怕多一个人露出笑容。\n只要大家都能笑起来，世界一定就能迎来和平！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_i:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e027fffe360bf7c44e05c36c7b5efd7c83543185c2dd2106e48c1aa736b418e0",
      "text": "所以……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_i:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e36448b3879c5cd4d4d4e38d250970e3fa8a98368fb4f27c0faf2043f5f8eb11",
      "text": "属下虽明白皮埃尔大人的志向，\n但考虑到您作为一国王子的立场……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_i:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90e41a3613d20cd6f6a69fb08a308347eba23dfa82e0eb80886b27b86f7cdcdf",
      "text": "在这个国家，我既不是王子也不是什么大人物。\n只是普通的皮埃尔。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_i:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6677aad124959b010d84891004774b0aeb9bead9e72547a278f7d64f99b24eb5",
      "text": "根本没有必要去在意立场吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_i:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e9ba118f1396a5e83cd139e6575f4142861a7c99900b2349476bb5520f5f9c4",
      "text": "而且，我听说母后留学的时候，也曾偷偷\n在可丽饼店打过工呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_i:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf97a86e89f14fa8d0d2858642aff358a82d7ecc61b74043fecbbb8f350f0f6c",
      "text": "什、什么！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_i:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:731777f9b9e1fe14f340109fbff41ab2eed3f0d64eb2c2887f2c51d833ce6bb0",
      "text": "她说在那里遇到了很多人，\n学到了许许多多的事情……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_i:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffd37557933c96ae61c7bf146a27153fe205426310d590121e7eb890a553683b",
      "text": "我觉得母后送我出来，\n也一定是想让我像那样去学习各种东西的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_i:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8b3a64851a3249954384d76ba907387a6bbe6d2e41e5899eb6892c1cc9fad41",
      "text": "……属下明白了。\n但是，有一个条件。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_i:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdbd46c1fdbffccafacd31871210b4ed45084045c219237be5aa804758828d05",
      "text": "条件？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
